{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2aecd5c9566a0f74","name":"Traversing the Minefield","source":{"id":"source:reference-2aecd5c9566a0f74","title":"Traversing the Minefield","revision":21273,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:28:32Z","sha256":"37a3b7cc0940aa93ed2f1b2e5b54896b0a7c63a9d327ca2628359c21f39c7c1f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21273","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Traversing%20the%20Minefield&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2aecd5c9566a0f74","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," is intended for use in a combat encounter in which the ground has been seeded with a variety of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Antipersonnel Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Antipersonnel_Mines"},". The heroes must find a way to traverse the minefield while defeating their opponents. Failure can trigger explosions, and Success helps other members of the party identify locations where the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"}," have been placed.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Traversing the Minefield Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 1 (5 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Technology)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Technology)"}," (DC 19):"]}," The heroes can attempt to recall knowledge about the nature of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Antipersonnel Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Antipersonnel_Mines"},", gaining clues that could indicate what different types of buried ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"}," look like."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 19):"]}," The heroes can try to notice signs of upturned soil or other indicators of the placement of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," (DC 24):"]}," The heroes can attempt to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to sense spots where great danger awaits them, likely indicating the presence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Degrees of Failure"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Degrees_of_Failure","referenceId":"reference:8d28a4bee6e70b14"},":"]}," Each time the heroes fail a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," while in the minefield, they trigger an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Antipersonnel Mine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Antipersonnel_Mine","referenceId":"reference:b947db88deed3e0e"}," in an adjacent space."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Degrees of Success"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Degrees_of_Success","referenceId":"reference:5059731ee2f0416b"},":"]},"  Each time the heroes earn a Success while in the minefield, they learn the locations of at least three active ",{"tag":"a","children":["Antipersonnel Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Antipersonnel_Mines"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:563191d8a5e759b3"},":"]}," The heroes must act in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Order"}," during the Skill Challenge."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes learn the location of every ",{"tag":"a","children":["Antipersonnel Mine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Antipersonnel_Mine","referenceId":"reference:b947db88deed3e0e"}," in the field and can see all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"}," on the battle map.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," The heroes fail to identify any more ",{"tag":"a","children":["Antipersonnel Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Antipersonnel_Mines"}," and must risk triggering undetected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"}," as they cross the field.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
